Climate-related Disclosure Requirements:
Entities must keep climate-related disclosure (CRD) records and file climate statements annually.
Climate statements must disclose climate risks, governance approaches, and greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions.
Reports must follow XRB climate standards and be lodged with the Registrar.
Assurance Requirements:
