Civil liability and pecuniary penalties up to NZD 5 million for serious violations.
The Act aligns New Zealand’s financial sector with international climate disclosure standards and ensures investors, regulators, and the public have transparent information on climate risks and sustainability practices.', 'New Zealand', 'climate', 'in_force', '2021-01-01'::date, 'New Zealand', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/130_1', ARRAY['sdg13', 'regulations', 'sdg7', 'sdg11', 'mandatory', 'sdg16', 'new zealand', 'sdg15', 'disclosure', 'sdg9']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('abda9dc2-c21d-506d-a005-a5034b3f9c05', 'New Zealand Financial Sector (Climate-related Disclosures and Other Matters)', 'Financial Sector (Climate-related Disclosures and Other Matters) Amendment Bill', 'This Act is the Financial Sector (Climate-related Disclosures and Other Mat‐ ters) Amendment Act 2021.', 'This Act is the Financial Sector (Climate-related Disclosures and Other Mat‐ ters) Amendment Act 2021.', 'This Act is the Financial Sector (Climate-related Disclosures and Other Mat‐ ters) Amendment Act 2021.', 'New Zealand', 'climate', 'in_force', '2021-01-01'::date, 'New Zealand', 'https://www.carrotsandsticks.org/policies/130_18', ARRAY['sdg13', 'other sustainability policy', 'regulations', 'mandatory', 'new zealand', 'sdg15']::text[]) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO regulations (id, title, formal_title, summary, description, full_description, region, category, status, effective_date, source_name, source_url, tags) VALUES ('e96eca6d-2f31-5efa-bbe4-e3170882909d', 'New Zealand Climate Change Response (Zero Carbon) Amendment Act', 'Climate Change Response (Zero Carbon) Amendment Act', 'The Climate Change Response (Zero Carbon) Amendment Act 2019 amends the Climate Change Response Act 2002 to set a framework for reducing greenhouse gas emissions and addressing climate change adaptation in New Zealand. The Act aligns with the Paris Agreement and establishes legally binding emission reduction targets.

Key provisions include:

2050 Target:
Net-zero emissions for all greenhouse gases except biogenic methane by 2050.
Biogenic methane reduction targets: 10% by 2030 and 24-47% by 2050 (from 2017 levels).
Climate Change Commission (CCC):
An independent body to advise the government on emission budgets, policies, and adaptation strategies.
Monitors and reports on progress toward climate goals.
Emissions Budgets:
Set in five-year periods to ensure a gradual reduction in emissions.
First three budgets cover 2022-2025, 2026-2030, and 2031-2035.
Emissions Reduction Plan:
The government must develop policies to meet emissions budgets.
Includes sector-specific measures for transport, energy, industry, and agriculture.
National Adaptation Plan:
Requires a National Climate Change Risk Assessment every six years.
Identifies climate risks and outlines adaptation strategies.
The Act ensures that New Zealand moves toward a low-emissions economy, balancing climate action with economic and social considerations.', 'The Climate Change Response (Zero Carbon) Amendment Act 2019 amends the Climate Change Response Act 2002 to set a framework for reducing greenhouse gas emissions and addressing climate change adaptation in New Zealand. The Act aligns with the Paris Agreement and establishes legally binding emission reduction targets.

